---
import CatalogView from "@/components/views/CatalogView.astro";

---

<CatalogView pageTitle="Индивидуальные решения" bottomForm="getform" noFilter>
  <div class="individual">
    <section class="individual__item">
      <aside>
        <span class="_num">1</span>
        <span class="_stage">этап</span>
      </aside>
      <div class="_image">
        <img src="/images/individual-stage-1.png" alt="">
      </div>
      <p>Описываем процесс работы с клиентом по индивидуальному решению.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="individual__item">
      <aside>
        <span class="_num">2</span>
        <span class="_stage">этап</span>
      </aside>
      <div class="_image">
        <img src="/images/individual-stage-2.png" alt="">
      </div>
      <p>Структурируем этапы, и шаги в этапах</p>
    </section>

    <section class="individual__item">
      <aside>
        <span class="_num">3</span>
        <span class="_stage">этап</span>
      </aside>
      <div class="_image">
        <img src="/images/individual-stage-3.png" alt="">
      </div>
      <p>Подбираем изображения</p>
    </section>

    <section class="individual__item">
      <aside>
        <span class="_num">4</span>
        <span class="_stage">этап</span>
      </aside>
      <div class="_image">
        <img src="/images/individual-stage-4.png" alt="">
      </div>
      <p>Красиво оформляем</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</CatalogView>
